DESCRIPTION:North Carolina mutual aid groups made headlines for organizing 
 during disasters. But these groups do other planning-related work year-rou
 nd\, too: rides\, food distribution\, tiny homes\, repairs\, land for enca
 mpments\, organizing against abusive landlords\, and more.\n\n \n\nJoin Tr
 iangle Mutual Aid founder Devin Ceartas for an interactive lunch conversat
 ion: How is mutual aid different from charity or government services? How 
 can professional planning help or hinder mutual aid work? What can planner
 s learn from mutual aid?
GEO:35.912697;-79.050261
LOCATION:New East \, Reading Room\, Room 201
SUMMARY:Mutual Aid and Planning
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/mutual-aid-and-planning
CATEGORIES:Meetings and Conferences
END:VEVENT
