DESCRIPTION:THIS EVENT IS FULL -  contact David Anderson at <a href="mai
 lto:d47anders@gmail.com" target="_blank"><u><u>d47anders@gmail.com</u></u>
 </a> if you wish to be included on the wait list. New Hope Bird Alliance 
 will take a group to the annual Thrush Event at a colleague’s home near 
 the eastern end of Falls Lake. His yard has been cultivated with trees and
  plants that attract thrushes migrating through in the fall. We also will 
 see migrating warblers\, vireos\, and other species.
