 ck midway water stop\n\\- Competitive section\\(s\\) announced in advance 
 \\(with regroup on mid\\-ride sprints\\)\n\nOur goal is to be safe\, smoot
 h\, and fast with a mixture of double paceline and rotation.\n\nThis is NO
 T a no-drop ride although we will look after each other\, particularly wit
 h regard to mechanicals. Please feel free to sit in--just don't compete if
  you haven't been working.\n\nIf you are not a Tarwheels member\, please s
 ign this [waiver](http://tarwheels.net/ewaiver) before the ride.
