DESCRIPTION:Carolina Tarwheels Cycling Club\n**Sunday Scramble™** from *
 *MLK Jr Park** averaging **18'ish mph**. Your choice to drive the pace\, p
 unch the hills or lay back and draft -- let's be safe\, friendly\, call ou
 t hazards and show respect to all. We can re-group at major intersections 
 if necessary to keep the group together. Stopping at **Lou's Bakery (Mile 
 23.3)** for refreshments and conversation. On the return\, feel free to ra
 ce back once we pass **Maple View Ice Cream** for the final **4.9 miles**.
 \n\nNo ride if raining or severe threat. All usual Tarwheels rules apply r
 egarding waiver and behavior. If you have not recently looked over Tarwhee
 ls ride policies\, please take a moment to consult:\nhttp://tarwheels.net/
 wp/policies/\n\n**Make sure that you have filled out the waiver before att
 ending this ride.** Guests are asked to fill out a waiver for each ride. M
 embers need only do it once per calendar year.\nhttp://tarwheels.net/ewaiv
 er\n\n**The updated route for October 11:**\nhttps://ridewithgps.com/route
 s/56550804
LAST-MODIFIED:20261004T000959Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
