DESCRIPTION:Triangle Off Road Cyclists (TORC)\nWe'll meet at the Great Mea
 dow Park pavilion for a preview of the 12-mile Rootrock MTB race course.\n
 \nThis will be a casual pace\, no drop ride. If riders want to session any
  sections of the course we'll stop and do that. I'm budgeting 2.5 hours fo
 r this ride (6mph plus stops)\, but it may take less time.\n\nThere is als
 o a course preview ride on October 3rd @ 2pm if this time doesn't work for
  you.
