BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.unc.edu/event/university-day-in-wilson-library"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:UNC Chapel Hill
DTSTAMP:20261010T052518Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54108812372564
DTSTART:20261012T133000Z
DTEND:20261012T203000Z
DESCRIPTION:On October 12\, in commemoration of University Day\, Wilson Lib
 rary will host a Carolina History Trivia event and provide a rare opportun
 ity to view two of the oldest and most significant items from the universi
 ty history collections.\n\nFrom 11:00-1:00 p.m. on October 12\, the Univer
 sity Archives will host Carolina History Trivia in front of Wilson Library
 . Students and others are encouraged to drop by and test their knowledge o
 n the history of UNC-Chapel Hill. Participants will compete head-to-head a
 nd have an opportunity to win prizes.\n\nThe library will also feature a o
 ne-day-only display of two unique artifacts:\n\nThe original plaque placed
  into the cornerstone of Old East on October 12\, 1793. This artifact has 
 a direct tie to the ceremony held to begin construction for the university
 . It also has a fascinating history\, disappearing from campus for more th
 an 40 years before being discovered at a foundry in Tennessee and returned
  to Chapel Hill in 1916. Learn more: https://www.unc.edu/posts/2025/10/03/
 the-old-east-plaque-once-mysteriously-disappeared/\n \nA diploma from UNC
 ’s first commencement\, 1798. After opening in 1795\, Carolina held its 
 first commencement in July 1798. Seven students earned degrees that day\, 
 including Hinton James\, the first student to attend the university. The d
 iploma on display was awarded to Adam Springs\, a student from Mecklenburg
  County who was part of the first graduating class. It is handwritten on p
 archment and signed by several of the early trustees\, including William R
 ichardson Davie.\n\n\nThese artifacts will be on exhibit in the Wilson Lib
 rary main lobby from 9:30-4:30 p.m. on October 12.
GEO:35.90984;-79.050769
LOCATION:Wilson Library 
SUMMARY:University Day in Wilson Library
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/university-day-in-wilson-libra
 ry
CATEGORIES:Exhibits
END:VEVENT
