DESCRIPTION:Carolina Tarwheels Cycling Club\n**NOTE SPECIAL 800AM START TI
 ME AS KIRK WILL BE IN TOWN**\n\n**Weekday Scramble™** from **Gold Park**
  averaging 18-19'ish mph. Your choice to drive the pace\, punch the hills 
 or lay back and draft -- let's be safe\, friendly\, call out hazards and s
 how respect to all. We can re-group at major intersections if necessary to
  keep the group together. After an uphill warm up to Revere Road\, we'll s
 top at **Flat River Cafe** (Mile 21.3) for some caffeine\, brunch and conv
 ersation. On the return\, once we turn left onto West Ten Road\, feel free
  to take off for the last 4 miles.\n\nNo ride if raining or severe threat.
  All usual Tarwheels rules apply regarding waiver and behavior. If you hav
 e not recently looked over Tarwheels ride policies\, please take a moment 
 to consult:\nhttp://tarwheels.net/wp/policies/\n**Make sure that you have 
 filled out the waiver before attending this ride.**\nGuests are asked to f
 ill out a waiver for each ride. Members need only do it once per calendar 
 year.\nhttp://tarwheels.net/ewaiver\n\n**The Route for October 13:**\nhttp
 s://ridewithgps.com/routes/55452848
LAST-MODIFIED:20261004T000959Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
