DESCRIPTION:Triangle Off Road Cyclists (TORC)\nHarris Lake every Tuesday a
 fter work\, depending on trail conditions. Check [www.torc-nc.org](http://
 www.torc-nc.org/) for current trail status. Ride time will start 2 hours b
 efore sunset.\nJust looking to have fun on the bikes so all skill levels a
 re welcome. We typically average \\~10mph but stop at all intersections to
  let everyone regroup. No drop ride.\nMeet time: 5:15\nRide time: 5:30\nDi
 stance: 7-8 miles\nLocation: Harris Lake County Park\nWhat to bring:\nBike
  in good working order\nHelmet\nHydration\nWe will meet in the Hogs Run pa
 rking lot. I drive a Nissan Xterra typical wear a yellow jersey\nAfter the
  ride we will got to La Taberna Mexican Bar & Grill in Apex off of 55 for 
 Tacos and Beers!\n2026 season ride waiver: [https://www.webscorer.com/regi
 ster?raceid=415052](https://www.webscorer.com/register?raceid=415052)\nPle
 ase consider joining the TORC\, we are a 501c3 org and part of your member
 ship fee goes back to TORC to finance trail maintenance and trail building
 . You can sign up as an individual basic membership for $39. Membership wi
 ll help represent our dirt loving interests in the Triangle: [https://www.
 torc-nc.org/sorba/](https://www.torc-nc.org/sorba/)
LAST-MODIFIED:20261004T001007Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://www.meetup.com/torc-nc/events/316271672/
X-SOURCE:Triangle Cycling
END:VEVENT
