DESCRIPTION:The Museum Store is in transition\, and our team is hard at work reimagining its role. For a limited time\, we are offering a major sale on existing merchandise. Members will receive exclusive access to the sale on Tuesday\, October 13 before we open the sale to the public on Wednesday\, October 14. Items are discounted at 75%\, so don’t miss your chance to shop! Sale may end early depending on availability of merchandise; please check the calendar for updates. \nPlease note\, we will only accept cards and not cash. Membership purchases and renewals will not be available during this time. All items are final sale\, and member discounts cannot be combined with the clearance sale.
