 xcited to partner with one of our incredible Chamber members\, The Chamber
  Orchestra of the Triangle (COT)\, for a FREE lunchtime musical experience
  featuring the world-renowned Verona Quartet! That's right! Great music\, 
 great company\, and a lunch break unlike any other\, right here at the Gre
 ater Durham Chamber of Commerce! The Chamber Orchestra of the Triangle has
  been enriching our region through exceptional orchestral performances\, m
 usic education\, and community engagement since 1982. Dedicated to making 
 classical music accessible and inspiring audiences of all ages\, COT conti
 nues to demonstrate the incredible role the arts play in bringing communit
 ies together. And we absolutely LOVE having The Chamber Orchestra of the T
 riangle as a member of the Greater Durham Chamber of Commerce! Their commi
 tment to creativity\, culture\, education\, and community is e
