DESCRIPTION:AI isn't going away\, so the real question is whether it's maki
 ng you sharper or making you soft. New research shows that people who use 
 AI to hand them finished answers actually get worse at the underlying skil
 l once the AI is taken away. But people who use AI for hints\, critique\, 
 and sharpening their own explanations keep those gains a week later.\n\n \
 n\nThis session is for anyone who's wondered what AI is really doing to th
 e way we think.
