 ake Forest Area Chamber's Fall Oyster Roast\, presented by Wildberry Pedia
 tric Dentistry\, is a relaxed outdoor gathering designed to bring together
  Chamber members\, business leaders\, and the community for an unforgettab
 le fall evening. Whether you're a longtime oyster enthusiast or just comin
 g for the barbecue\, fire pits\, music\, and conversation\, there's someth
 ing for everyone. As the inaugural year of what we hope becomes a beloved 
 Chamber tradition\, this event is all about celebrating our business commu
 nity in a casual\, welcoming atmosphere. Come reconnect with familiar face
 s\, make new connections\, and enjoy an authentic Southern experience.
