BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Gcal Cb2Ajgfjpk6Bf9Gifg6Kg2Hn1S": "https://www.meetup.com/torc-nc/events/316259060/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_cb2ajgfjpk6bf9gifg6kg2hn1s
SUMMARY:Carolina North Forest Gravel + Gab (evening edition)
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261015T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261015T193000
DTSTAMP:20261010T053329Z
UID:event_316259060@meetup.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261015T173000
SEQUENCE:1
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261004T001006Z
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Off Road Cyclists (TORC)\n* **Title:** Carolina North
  Forest Gravel + Gab (evening edition)\n* **Intended audience:** The grave
 l curious to the gravel enthusiast. This is an beginner-level\, no-drop (n
 o one is left behind) ride from Back Alley Bikes over to the gravel roads 
 of Carolina North Forest. Riders with gravel experience are welcome\, but 
 **we will prioritize good vibes and comfortable group riding** over speed 
 and intensity.\n* **Distance:** 15 miles ([route](https://ridewithgps.com/
 routes/54012358))\n* **Pace:** 10-12 mph and conversational\n* **Duration:
 ** About 2.5 hours\n* **Meet** @5:30pm @ [Back Alley Bikes](https://maps.a
 pp.goo.gl/Vg8FUof42TmzNb6F6)\, **Wheels rolling** @ 5:45pm\n* Helmets are 
 required\n* ***Hot days are dangerous! Please come hydrated\, bring plenty
  of water\, and tell a leader if you feel dizzy\, lightheaded\, clammy\, f
 atigued\, cramps\, or nausea.***\n* **Please fill out the [2026 TORC ride 
 waiver](https://www.torc-nc.org/waiver/).** You only need fill it out 1 ti
 me per year.\n* Other attire: Attire is good\, yes\, and whatever floats y
 our boat. Some of us ride in boots\, some clip in. Dress for the weather/c
 onditions.\n* Water bottle/pack\, mini-tool\, spare tube/tubeless supplies
 \, and pump/CO2 highly recommended.\n* No headphones or other distractions
 \n* Post-ride drinks at [Steel String Brewery Carrboro](https://maps.app.g
 oo.gl/VA3AiH5RymVQ8TKPA) (subject to change day-of)\n* **Bring lights for 
 riding home!**\n* Message me with any questions you may have.\n\n**HOW TO 
 HELP TORC HELP YOU:**\nIf you aren't a member of TORC please consider join
 ing. Trails are not cheap to build or easy to maintain. So much goes on be
 hind the scenes at all the trails. If you love trails please [consider joi
 ning TORC](https://www.torc-nc.org/join-torc/) to help support the work TO
 RC does. Not ready to join? You can [donate to TORC](https://www.torc-nc.o
 rg/join-torc/) to support our mission at the bottom of that page.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261004T001007Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://www.meetup.com/torc-nc/events/316259060/
X-SOURCE:Triangle Cycling
END:VEVENT
