SUMMARY:Member Discovery Day - Leaves and Legends
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season with us at our fall Member Discovery Day and get ready for our upcoming “Dragons” exhibition. Members are invited to enjoy a cozy night of mini pumpkin painting\, apple cider\, and fall-themed programs designed for curious minds of all ages. \nActivities include: \n\nPaint your own mini-pumpkin.\nEnjoy fall themed deserts and apple cider.\nMeet the Halloween Animals at 6:30pm and 7:15pm.\nCapture the moment at our photo booth\, with complimentary take home photo strips!\nand more…\n\nCurrent membership and pre-registration required. Not a member yet? Join today! \nRegister Now
