SUMMARY:The Founder's Clinic @AU
DESCRIPTION:The Founder's Clinic is a live\, in-person experience designed 
 to give founders real help on real problems. ​Think of it as urgent car
 e for your startup.\nA team will triage your situation and connect you wit
 h the right support\, beginning with a “primary care” coach\, then a s
 ubject matter “specialist” for a “second opinion” focused on your 
 specific needs. ​Regardless of your situation\, you'll receive high-impa
 ct\, thoughtful support from experienced members of our startup community 
 who want to improve the health of you and your startup.\nThis event is par
 t of the Raleigh-Durham Startup Series. Sign up here.\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://americantobacco.co/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/10/founders-clinic.jpeg
