DESCRIPTION:No advance registration required to receive your flu vaccinatio
 n on campus at the pop-up flu clinics. Please bring both your UNC One Card
  and health insurance card.\n\n \n\nIf you have not done so previously\, p
 lease register with UNC MyChart by completing your personal information\, 
 including a scanned copy of your ID and/or insurance card.\n\n \n\nThe vac
 cine administered at all walk-in clinics is Sanofi’s Fluzone Influenza V
 accine.\n\n \n\nMost insurance providers offer flu vaccination with no cop
 ay.  This event is brought to you by Employee Health Services (EHS) and UN
 C Health Campus Care.\n\n \n\nLocations:\n\nThursday\, Oct. 1 – Koury Or
 al Health Sciences Building\, Atrium LobbyThursday\, Oct. 8 – Michael Ho
 oker Research Center\, Lower Level Atrium CANCELLEDFriday\, Oct. 16 – Fe
 tzer Hall\, Room 104 (Employee Appreciation Day)Thursday\, Oct. 22 – Kou
 ry Oral Health Sciences Building\, Atrium Lobby
LOCATION:Locations vary\, see description
