DESCRIPTION:No Kings: Party at the Polls: Vote Early Durham Location #1 of
  3\n\nJoin the Durham Resistance Coalition\, Engaged Defenders for Democra
 cy\, League of Women Voters Orange and Durham County\, Democracy Out Loud!
 \, Men 4 Choice\, SURJ\, Carolina Federation\, and Siembra NC as we host a
  No Kings Party at the Polls to help this nation break a record and have t
 he biggest turnout on an early voting day! \n\nThis will not be a typical 
 No Kings event. This will be a Party at the Polls where we will have music
  and food but no speakers. \n\nThe event goes from 10am-12pm.\n\nThe purpo
 se is two-fold: 1. Encourage as many to vote on Oct 17th as possible\, and
  2. Sign up for ways to plug in and encourage early voting.\n\nIn Durham\,
  we will have three geographic locations and ask that people spread out an
 d not all choose our &quot\;normal&quot\; spot:\n\n1. South Regional Libra
 ry\n2. Durham County Board of Elections \n3. Main Library\n\nThis link is 
 for the Durham County Board of Elections. We will meet at Shoppes of Hope 
 Valley: 3825 S Roxboro St\, Durham\, NC 27713\n\nThe event goes from 10-12
 . We will send waves of people to march to the polls to not overwhelm the 
 polling station. \n\nWe are asking for donations for the food please:\n\n<
 a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.gofundme.com/f/join-us-fo
 r-the-no-kings-rally-in-durham-county&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;
 usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0xEgv6dExBCRtX3gRZVA_-" target="_blank">https://www.g
 ofundme.com/f/join-us-for-the-no-kings-rally-in-durham-county</a> \n\nSee 
 you at the Party for the Polls and please spread the word! \n\nPlease join
  our Substack: <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://substack.com/
 profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=cale
 ndar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3y7Kv9RwiMPWcPPUFQih9k" target="_blank">htt
 ps://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy</a> \n\n
 For more ED4D Mobilize Events: <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https
 ://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=cale
 ndar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1xqNbFip0P6DfK4plFB1D7" target="_blank">htt
 ps://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/</a> \n\n\n**We decide wh
 o represents us. We decide what comes next.**\n\nFor more than a year\, mi
 llions of people have come together to reject the idea that power belongs 
 to kings\, billionaires\, or politicians who believe they are above the pe
 ople and the law.\n\nNow\, we are taking the next step\, turning people po
 wer into voter power. Unlike previous No Kings actions\, No Kings: Vote Ea
 rly\,  is not purely a protest. Instead\, on October 17th\, it&#39\;s a da
 y of nonpartisan voter participation: we are bringing **our community** to
 gether to make a plan to vote early and ensuring every eligible voter unde
 rstands their options for how to vote and has the opportunity to make thei
 r voice heard.\n\nBecause no one person gets to decide our leaders before 
 voters do. On October 17th\, join us in local events across the country as
  we get out the early vote and say it loud: no thrones\, no crowns\, no ki
 ngs. \n\n*No Kings: Vote Early events are nonpartisan and are designed to 
 increase participation from all eligible voters.* \n\n*A core principle be
 hind all No Kings events is a commitment to nonviolent action. We expect a
 ll participants to seek to de-escalate any potential confrontation with th
 ose who disagree with our values and to act lawfully at these events. Weap
 ons of any kind\, including those legally permitted\, should not be brough
 t to events.*\n\nHow to prepare:\n📢: How to Prepare for Your Event:\n
 ✅: Update your voter registration → <a href="https://www.google.com/ur
 l?q=https://www.vote.org/am-i-registered-to-vote/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=ca
 lendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0qTOg8FaytGnP7DDSuHWa-" target="_blank">h
 ttps://www.vote.org/am-i-registered-to-vote/</a>\n✅: Recruit friends →
  We start in our own communities and neighborhoods\, where voting happens.
  Triple your impact by inviting three people.\n✅: Broaden your impact  
 → Post photos/videos with #NoKingsVoteEarly and encourage others to vote
 \n\n<a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.mobilize.us/nokings/
 event/1033295/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0v
 YXUCuYY_BM12K2QH4QhZ" target="_blank">https://www.mobilize.us/nokings/even
 t/1033295/</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20261010T003845Z
LOCATION:Shoppes of Hope Valley\, 3825 S Roxboro St\, Durham\, NC\, 27713
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (In Person)
END:VEVENT
