SUMMARY:Music on the Lawn | Screamin' Bridge and The Martin County Ramblers
DESCRIPTION:Come to the ATC Lawn on a fall Saturday afternoon and enjoy the
  sweet\, homegrown bluegrass sounds of Screamin' Bridge.\n\nThe band will 
 then reassemble at 6pm as The Martin County Ramblers to perform a Southern
  Rock show\, and trust us\, they are GOOD.\n\nThis is a free show\, open t
 o the public\, and all are welcome. Bring a lawn chair or blanket\, purcha
 se food and drinks from ATC restaurants\, and enjoy some tunes outdoors!
