DESCRIPTION:As part of UNC Research Week\, join us in-person for a Qualitat
 ive Research Journal Club Coffee Hour!\n\n \n\nThis will be a chance to co
 nnect with others conducting qualitative research and discuss the followin
 g article: Jones\, K. M. (2025). Generative AI in qualitative research and
  related transparency problems: A novel heuristic for disclosing uses of A
 I. International Journal of Qualitative Methods\, 24\, 16094069251404329. 
 \n\n \n\nRegistration is required and space is limited! Coffee\, tea\, and
  pastries will be provided.\n\nClick here to Register.\n\nDiscussion Facil
 itators:\n \n\nMaryBeth Grewe\, MPH\nProgram Manager\, Qualitative Researc
 h Service\nResearch Specialist\, Patient and Community Engagement in Resea
 rch (PaCER) Program\n\n \n\nSimone Frank\, MPH\nSenior Project Manager\, P
 atient and Community Engagement in Research (PaCER) Program\nResearch Spec
 ialist\, Qualitative Research Service
