 of TDSL will take 10-15 minutes to introduce and discuss their various pro
 jects and collaborations.\n\n \n\nRegister\n\n \n\nSeminars in the TraCS D
 ata Science Lab Seminar Series cover a range of topics related to health c
 are data science\, clinical data\, data engineering\, and working in these
  areas at UNC-Chapel Hill. These hybrid seminars are usually held monthly 
 on the third Tuesday of each month from 12:30-1:30 p.m. in the NC TraCS su
 ite (room 219) on the 2nd floor of Brinkhous-Bullitt or via Zoom.
