DESCRIPTION:Join the Global Food Research Program (GFRP) and two former stu
 dents at the Carolina Population Center to learn about FERN\, our summer f
 ellowship program for undergraduate students. FERN aims to strengthen the 
 future \nnutrition research workforce by providing hands-on experience in 
 food and nutrition policy research\, particularly addressing nutrition-rel
 ated healt disparities among historically marginalized communities.\n\n \n
 \nHear from former FERN fellows about their experience and what they’ve 
 gone on to do after the program.\n\n \n\nInformation about FERN eligibilit
 y and application dates can be found on the GFRP website
