 fferent questions and contexts.\n\n \n\nThis workshop is offered by the Un
 iversity Libraries Health Sciences Library and led by Emma Barrett-Catton.
  It is part of the Systematic Review Methods and Advancing Clinical Resear
 ch Skills workshop tracks.
