BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_enoriver_org_9u7o786v1jlk6heq5cp3k1gr1k
SUMMARY:ERA - Let’s Go Hike! Fall Drop-In Hike
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261022T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261022T183000
DTSTAMP:20261010T053257Z
UID:7kd3i9bgopqqf8sarl3ss3k5ip@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261022T170000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260928T200038Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Join us for a <b>fall drop-in hike</b> along the Eno River!
 </p><p><b>Registration is not required</b> for <i>Let’s Go Hike</i> outi
 ngs\, so come on out at <b>5 PM</b> for this <b>~2.25-mile</b> Cabelands 
 to Eno Quarry hike. We plan to complete the hike in about <b>1.5 hours</b>
  so that we can return to the parking lot before sunset\, but if you’re 
 concerned about navigating in low light\, <b>feel free to bring a headlamp
  or flashlight</b> just in case. These trails are of <b>moderate difficul
 ty</b> with several rocky sections and a few short\, steep inclines. </p
 ><p>Your guide will share some information about the area along the way\, 
 but the primary focus is on getting outside\, moving your body\, enjoying 
 the trails\, and connecting with others. We’ll keep a comfortable\, conv
 ersational pace and regroup as needed along the way.</p><p>Please feel fre
 e to bring water and snacks. Wear comfortable\, weather-appropriate clothi
 ng and shoes. Well-behaved dogs are welcome as long as they are under your
  control and on a 6 foot leash.</p><p>Meet in the <b>Cabelands parking lot
 </b>\, at the end of Howe Street\, off of Sparger Road in Durham (4950 How
 e Street\, Durham NC\, 27705).</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260929T200108Z
LOCATION:Cabelands Trail\, 4950 Howe St\, Durham\, NC 27705\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Eno River Association
END:VEVENT
