DESCRIPTION:Got a Big Idea? Pitch It to the Vice Chancellor for Innovation\
 , Entrepreneurship and Economic Development.\n\nEver had a genius idea in 
 the shower\, during a boring lecture\, or at 2am with your roommates and t
 hought "someone should actually build this"? You're that someone. \n\nJoin
  us at The Pit on October 22\, from 2:00–4:00 PM for a chance to pitch y
 our business idea directly to Vice Chancellor Tommy Sowers. No suits requi
 red\, no boardrooms\, no gatekeeping. Just Tar Heels with ideas and a VC w
 ho wants to hear them.\n\nWhether it's an app\, a startup\, a campus hack\
 , a wild sustainability idea\, or the next big Carolina brand\, bring your
  pitch\, your energy\, and your Carolina blue confidence.\n\nWhat to expec
 t:\n\nCasual\, high-energy pitch sessions right in the heart of campusReal
  feedback from a leader who actually wants to help turn your idea into act
 ionA chance to connect with fellow student founders and dreamersBragging r
 ights for pitching at The Pit (it's basically a UNC rite of passage at thi
 s point)📍 Where: The Pit\, Carolina Union\n🗓️ When: October 22 | 2
 :00–4:00 PM\n💡 Who: Any Carolina student with an idea worth sharing
GEO:35.910243;-79.047568
LOCATION:Carolina Union - The Pitt
SUMMARY:Pitch in the Pit
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/pitch-in-the-pit
CATEGORIES:Meetings and Conferences
END:VEVENT
