DTEND:20261023T213000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a theatrical performance and conversation with with
  Mike Wiley\, Trio Achiever–winning actor\, playwright\, and director an
 d artist-in-residence for the Kenan Institute for Ethics at Duke Universit
 y. The event will be modrated by Michael Betts ’11\, High Point Universi
 ty assistant professor of media production and studio manager.
GEO:35.912607;-79.053261
LOCATION:Hill Hall\, James and Susan Moeser Auditorium
SUMMARY:One Noble Journey: A Box Marked Freedom
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/one-noble-journey-a-box-marked
 -freedom
CATEGORIES:Performances
