DESCRIPTION:AMB Tires & Wheels Grand Opening & Ribbon Cutting Celebration!
  DURHAM\, GET READY TO ROLL! A NEW LOCATION\, BIGGER OPPORTUNITIES\, AND A
  WHOLE LOT TO CELEBRATE! The Greater Durham Chamber of Commerce is excited
  to join the AMB Tires & Wheels family as we celebrate the grand opening o
 f their SECOND location\, right here in Durham\, NC! AMB Tires & Wheels is
  a family-owned and operated business dedicated to helping customers upgra
 de their rides with quality products and personalized service. Specializin
 g in tires\, custom wheels\, lift kits\, and leveling kits\, AMB is all ab
 out helping you find the right fit for your vehicle\, whether you're looki
 ng for everyday reliability\, a bold new look\, or an upgrade that takes y
 our ride to the next level! And now\, they're bringing that same commitmen
 t to quality\, customer service\, and community to the Bull City! Join us 
 as we officially cut the ribbon\, welcome AMB Tires & Wheels to Durham\, a
 nd celebrate this exciting milestone with the family behind the bus
LOCATION:Durham\, NC
