DESCRIPTION:Organizations are investing in benefits to improve employee wel
 lbeing and taking on initiatives to foster a culture of wellbeing in the w
 orkplace. However\, many employees still feel that their job is an obstacl
 e to their wellbeing rather than a help. What can you do as a manager to s
 hift that perception? This session will discuss practical ways to show emp
 loyees that you and your organization support their wellbeing.\n\nClick on
  Carolina Talent registration link and select the “Request” button to 
 automatically enroll.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Supporting Employee Well-being: What Can You Do As A Manager
