DTSTART:20261027T200000Z
DTEND:20261027T213000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join Innovate Carolina for a fireside conversation with Tommy S
 owers\, Vice Chancellor for Innovation\, Entrepreneurship and Economic Dev
 elopment at UNC Chapel Hill\, about UNC's role in building stronger partne
 rships across North Carolina and supporting innovation and economic develo
 pment in the region. Hosted at 79°West in Pittsboro\, the conversation wi
 ll focus on the growing opportunities to connect UNC with communities\, en
 trepreneurs and North Carolina based companies throughout Central North Ca
 rolina. \n\n \n\nChatham County and Pittsboro are an important part of thi
 s regional ecosystem\, creating opportunities for UNC to build stronger re
 lationships with the communities and companies surrounding the university.
  The conversation will also highlight UNC's Industry Partnerships Initiati
 ve and its focus on developing meaningful relationships with North Carolin
 a companies. Together\, these partnerships can connect companies with UNC'
 s talent\, research\, innovation and entrepreneurial resources while creat
 ing opportunities for greater economic impact across the state. \n\n \n\nC
 ome hear Vice Chancellor Sowers share his perspective on Carolina's role i
 n the region\, the opportunities ahead for Central North Carolina\, and ho
 w stronger partnerships can benefit both the university and the communitie
 s around it.
GEO:35.757368;-79.164614
LOCATION:79 Degrees West
SUMMARY:Building Partnerships for Innovation: A Fireside Chat with Vice Cha
 ncellor Tommy Sowers
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/building-partnerships-for-inno
 vation-a-fireside-chat-with-vice-chancellor-tommy-sowers
CATEGORIES:Lectures
END:VEVENT
