DESCRIPTION:Engaged Defenders for Democracy<br> <br>Come join us every Th
 ursday from 7:30-9 am at American Tobacco Trail Bridge over I-40. Location
 : AMC Streets of Southpoint 8030 Renaissance Pkwy Durham\, NC 27713. . Par
 king lots are behind Southpoint Mall near the AMC theater or in the parkin
