BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Gcal Cb2Ajgfjpk6Bf9Gifg6Kg2Hn1S": "https://www.meetup.com/torc-nc/events/316802956/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_cb2ajgfjpk6bf9gifg6kg2hn1s
SUMMARY:Carolina North Forest Gravel + Gab
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261101T084500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261101T104500
DTSTAMP:20261010T053330Z
UID:event_316802956@meetup.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261101T084500
SEQUENCE:1
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261004T001006Z
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Off Road Cyclists (TORC)\n* **Title:** Carolina North
  Forest Gravel + Gab\n* **Intended audience:** The gravel curious to the g
 ravel enthusiast. This is a beginnermediate-level (\\*see distance & pace 
 below)\, no-drop (no one is left behind) ride from Back Alley Bikes over t
 o the gravel roads of Carolina North Forest. Riders with gravel experience
  are welcome\, but **we will prioritize good vibes and comfortable group r
 iding** over speed and intensity.\n* **Distance:** 15 miles ([route](https
 ://ridewithgps.com/routes/54012358))\n* **Pace:** 10-12 mph and conversati
 onal\n* **Duration:** About 2.5 hours\n* **Meet** @8:45am @ [Back Alley Bi
 kes](https://maps.app.goo.gl/Vg8FUof42TmzNb6F6)\, **Wheels rolling** @ 9am
 \n* Helmets are required\n* ***Hot days are dangerous! Please come hydrate
 d\, bring plenty of water\, and tell a leader if you feel dizzy\, lighthea
 ded\, clammy\, fatigued\, cramps\, or nausea.***\n* **Please fill out the 
 [2026 TORC ride waiver](https://www.torc-nc.org/waiver/).** You only need 
 fill it out 1 time per year.\n* Other attire: Attire is good\, yes\, and w
 hatever floats your boat. Some of us ride in boots\, some clip in. Dress f
 or the weather/conditions.\n* Water bottle/pack\, mini-tool\, spare tube/t
 ubeless supplies\, and pump/CO2 highly recommended.\n* No headphones or ot
 her distractions\n* Optional coffee and pastries after the ride at [Even D
 ough Bakery](https://www.evendough.net/_files/ugd/25157a_c98496ddedb04409a
 2c90324cfab6a22.pdf) (subject to change day-of)\n* Message me with any que
 stions you may have.\n\n**HOW TO HELP TORC HELP YOU:**\nIf you aren't a me
 mber of TORC please consider joining. Trails are not cheap to build or eas
 y to maintain. So much goes on behind the scenes at all the trails. If you
  love trails please [consider joining TORC](https://www.torc-nc.org/join-t
 orc/) to help support the work TORC does. Not ready to join? You can [dona
 te to TORC](https://www.torc-nc.org/join-torc/) to support our mission at 
 the bottom of that page.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261004T001007Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://www.meetup.com/torc-nc/events/316802956/
X-SOURCE:Triangle Cycling
END:VEVENT
