DTSTAMP:20261010T052519Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54161786960831
DTSTART:20261102T170000Z
DTEND:20261102T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:Workplace burnout is at an all-time high\, with one recent stud
 y reporting more than 42% of the workforce to be experiencing components o
 f burnout. This session will dive in the components of burnout\, create re
 flection opportunities for participants to assess their burnout levels\, a
 nd provide helpful options for pro-active self-care. Participants will ref
 lect on their “why” or their inner motivation for doing the work they 
 are doing and how to better connect their why to their everyday work to be
 come happier and healthier versions of themselves.\n\n \n\nClick on Caroli
 na Talent registration link and select the “Request” button to automat
 ically enroll.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Avoiding Burnout: Self-Assessment Methods and Self-Care Strategies
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/avoiding-burnout-self-assessme
 nt-methods-and-self-care-strategies
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
