SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261010T053303Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261105T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261105T150000
SUMMARY:Enterprise AI in Action: Build with Mistral’s Platform for Your 
 Custom AI Needs
DESCRIPTION:Data Science Raleigh\nAs Generative AI moves from experimentat
 ion to production\, the importance of sovereignty becomes critical for ent
 erprises. Mistral’s platform allows you to not only build\, customize an
 d scale solutions but also own your data and outcomes as the world’s lea
 ding pioneer in sovereign AI.\n\nThis session will explore how Mistral Stu
 dio\, Vibe and Forge give teams the building blocks for specialized AI sol
 utions built on Mistral’s highly customizable open-weight models. You’
 ll learn about real use cases powered by Mistral across industries such as
  financial services\, public sector\, manufacturing and more.\n\n**Key Tak
 eaways:**\n\n1️⃣ **Models:** Learn about Mistral's fundamentals across
  our horizontal model families — including text generation/understanding
 \, OCR\, Codestral for code generation and completion\, Voxtral for speech
  transcription and audio understanding\, and Pixtral for image recognition
  and vision.\n\n2️⃣ **Mistral Suite:** Discover how the platform allow
 s the building of agents and workflows under your control.\n\n3️⃣ **So
 vereign AI:** See how open source models can be customized for your needs 
 and deployed on-prem\, cloud or hybrid catered to your organizations owner
 ship requirements.\n\n4️⃣ **Demos:** See demos based on real industry 
 use cases.\n\nCome learn how the Mistral Suite provide scalable infrastruc
 ture for end-to-end transformation\, integrating open\, frontier models wi
 th deep domain expertise to deliver business-critical outcomes.\n\n**[Regi
 ster here](https://hubs.ly/Q04wGXpy0)**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/data-science-nc/events/316879110/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261007T070026Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261007T070026Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
