DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T103000
SUMMARY:Yoga In Nature™\, ALL LEVELS Vinyasa Flow\, NCMA
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\nALL LEVELS WELCOME. Join us for a viny
 asa flow (beginner friendly with options to level up) to yin practice endi
 ng in savasana. Join our community and meet other like-minded people! Yoga
  heals. Nature heals. Yoga In Nature™.\n\nPractice vinyasa flow to yin y
 oga at North Carolina Museum of Art\, outdoors near upper parking area in 
 grass ellipse... (NOTE THIS GRASS LOCATION\, as there are other groups tha
 t use NCMA grounds). WHEN YOU COME INTO THE PARKING LOT\, DRIVE TO WHERE T
 HE TWO PARKING LOTS ON BLUE RIDGE MEET. We practice in the grass Ellipse a
 rea:)\n$15/person\nCash\nVenmo @Darlene-Genander (0862)\nPaypal dgenander@
 yogainnature.com\nZelle\n\nCome flow with us. Meet others and make friends
  in our yoga community.\nBring a mat\; water\; and anything else you may n
 eed for your outdoor yoga practice. You may also want an old towel or plas
 tic liner for under your mat\, if the grass is damp. Wear layers.\nALL LEV
 ELS WELCOME.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/yogainnaturenc/events/316914805/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261009T200913Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261009T200913Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_41d85e1478a55e3b4adbf2e4951c5be9f6e49241ac55a65427c71d252849bf1c
SUMMARY:Defend Democracy Saturdays: Downtown Durham
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T113000
DTSTAMP:20261010T053253Z
UID:7vihpmeg1k6esqp5s5vsvq9hfe_R20260110T150000@google.com__20261114
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20251010T141601Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Please join Engaged Defenders for Democracy every Saturday 
 from 10am-11:30am with signs to protect our democracy and protest the viol
 ations to our Constitution. We will meet at the YMCA at 218 West Morgan St
 .</p><p>We need to fight for our democracy and stop and prevent future cut
 s that are hurting many. Bring friends! Bring signs that show your concern
  or are a call to action. Please avoid triggering images like swastikas.</
 p><p>See you every Saturday morning engaging drivers &amp\; pedestrians in
  Downtown Durham!</p><p>Please join our Substack:<span> </span><a href="h
 ttps://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy">https
 ://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy</a></p><p>
 For more ED4D Mobilize Events:<span> </span><a href="https://www.mobilize
 .us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersf
 ordemocracy/</a></p><p><a href="https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfor
 democracy/event/842514/">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocra
 cy/event/842514/</a> </p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260108T021307Z
LOCATION:218 W Morgan St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (In Person)
END:VEVENT
