 Slow spokes route collection</a></p><p>If you haven't signed the 2026 ride
  waiver form please sign before 1st ride. Only required once per year.</p>
 <p><a href="https://swiftcrm.com/cbcnc/waiver2026" target="_blank">Team CB
 C 2026 ride waiver</a></p>
