DESCRIPTION:<br><p>It's a faster paced and longer ride!</p><p>On Sundays w
 e cycle 20ish miles and the journey lasts roughly 1.5 hours depending on t
 he route. We're rolling roughly at 14-18mph. There is a leader but If you 
 want to go faster GO FOR IT. There will be limited support on this ride. T
 he group will start and finish at Crank Arm. Hang out and enjoy a beer aft
 er.</p><p>Don't forget your helmet.</p><p>Lets have fun and be safe!<br><b
 r></p><p>more info: <a href="https://www.meetup.com/crank-arm-cycling-runn
 ing-yoga/events/303334626/?eventOrigin=group_calendar">https://www.meetup.
 com/crank-arm-cycling-running-yoga/events/303334626/?eventOrigin=group_cal
 endar</a></p>
