SUMMARY:Mamma Mia! | Broadway @DPAC
DESCRIPTION:A mother. A daughter. 3 possible dads. And a trip down the aisl
 e you’ll never forget!\n\nSet on a Greek island paradise where the sun 
 always shines\, a tale of love\, friendship\, and identity is beautifully 
 told through the timeless hits of ABBA. On the eve of her wedding\, a daug
 hter’s quest to discover the father she’s never known brings three men
  from her mother’s past back to the island they last visited decades ago
 .\n\nFor over 25 years\, people all around the world have fallen in love w
 ith the characters\, the story\, and the music that make MAMMA MIA! the u
 ltimate feel-good show. Come see it during this six-day stay at DPAC. Get 
 your tickets here!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://americantobacco.co/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/07/Mamma-Mia.jpg
CATEGORIES:Performances
