 eginning of ride.<br>Please bring a water bottle(s) on your ride! there ar
 e no stops to refill.<br>Route collection<br><a href="https://ridewithgps.
 com/collections/8824647" target="_blank">2026 Slow spokes route collection
 </a><br>If you haven't signed the 2026 ride waiver form please sign before
  1st ride. Only required once per year.<br><a href="https://swiftcrm.com/c
 bcnc/waiver2026" target="_blank">Team CBC 2026 ride waiver</a></p><p>Looki
 ng for Ride leaders for the C group.</p>
