DESCRIPTION:FEATURING\n\nVictor Rosenbaum\, piano\n\n \n\nPROGRAM\n\n“LAS
 T WORDS\, LAST WORKS: The Final Solo Piano Pieces of Beethoven\, Brahms\, 
 and Schubert”\n\nLudwig van Beethoven  Six Bagatelles\, Opus 126\nJohann
 es Brahms  Four Piano Pieces\, Opus 119\nFranz Schubert  Sonata in B-flat 
 Major\, D. 960\n\n \n\nTICKETS\n\n$15 general admission\n$10 students\, fa
 culty\, and staff\nFree UNC Music students\, faculty\, and staff\n\nPurcha
 se tickets online. Tickets are also available at the door\, 30 minutes pri
 or to the concert start time.\n\n \n\nPARKING\n\nPlease plan to arrive ear
 ly as parking on campus can be tricky. Learn more about parking and direct
 ions to UNC-Chapel Hill’s campus.\n\n \n\nThis event is part of the 2026
 -2027 William S. Newman Artists Series\, a series of select concerts celeb
 rating the alliance of scholarship and performance that animates the lives
  of music faculty and students at Carolina.
GEO:35.912607;-79.053261
LOCATION:Hill Hall\, Moeser Auditorium
SUMMARY:Last Words\, Last Works” with Victor Rosenbaum\, piano | WSN 26-2
 7
